This is a list of [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]] expansions in other languages.

==English sets==
Only physically released sets are listed here. Translations made exclusively for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Online]] and [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Live]] are not included but can be found on each set's page.

